{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_3091C7DB","title":"Harper Oisiris Fourth Meeting","entry":"Dlg_3091C7DB::entry","exit":"Dlg_3091C7DB::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_AF830FA9","articyId":"72057752951743017","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Hey, when we spoke last time, was I being weird?","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, when we spoke last time, was I being weird?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":325.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"49652","byteOffset":33125704,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_ED63DBBD","articyId":"72057752951743038","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Oh what?! Oh no!","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh what?! Oh no!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":925.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33694","byteOffset":20631432,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_EACDF43A","articyId":"72057752951743051","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Well that's pretty much it. I have been feeling a little... stressed recently, and Ma Gomba offered me some edibles. When you met me, was I... mooing?","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well that's pretty much it. I have been feeling a little... stressed recently, and Ma Gomba offered me some edibles. When you met me, was I... mooing?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19858","byteOffset":15395216,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_862B034C","articyId":"72057752951743060","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Oh good! You must have spoken to me before it all started getting crazy.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Oh good! You must have spoken to me before it all started getting crazy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1500.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42340","byteOffset":30345752,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_4A93449E","articyId":"72057752951743082","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Apparently, and this is just what I heard, I tried to organize a \"Cow Choir.\" Like, I got a bunch of people to stand in a circle and moo in harmony.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Apparently, and this is just what I heard, I tried to organize a \"Cow Choir.\" Like, I got a bunch of people to stand in a circle and moo in harmony.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2100.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33088","byteOffset":20401384,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_8863FA34","articyId":"72057752951743096","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Dead serious. I even gave a speech about \"bovine unity.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Dead serious. I even gave a speech about \"bovine unity.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2700.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51505","byteOffset":33901328,"byteLength":400}},{"id":"DFr_B8589EB2","articyId":"72057752951743117","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"No, no, it gets worse. Supposedly, I crowned a milk carton \"King of the City\" and made everyone bow to it. Someone took a video. It's... circulating.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, no, it gets worse. Supposedly, I crowned a milk carton \"King of the City\" and made everyone bow to it. Someone took a video. It's... circulating.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3325.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20909","byteOffset":15793624,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_7F9087A4","articyId":"72057752951743132","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Don't mock me.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Don't mock me.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":3950.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47621","byteOffset":32353072,"byteLength":324}},{"id":"DFr_E7B78D1C","articyId":"72057752951743146","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"One guy said I had \"soulful mooing.\" Whatever that means. I've never even seen a cow.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"One guy said I had \"soulful mooing.\" Whatever that means. I've never even seen a cow.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":4575.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27092","byteOffset":18128552,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_0AF10880","articyId":"72057752951743160","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"I’m going to have to move to a different district when they lift the LUZ. Maybe change my name. Grow horns and just commit to the bit.","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I’m going to have to move to a different district when they lift the LUZ. Maybe change my name. Grow horns and just commit to the bit.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5225.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18672","byteOffset":14950320,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_E48B7A69","articyId":"72057821671256017","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"Meanwhile, can you maybe look out for my brother? You gave him the address, right?","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Meanwhile, can you maybe look out for my brother? You gave him the address, right?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5850.0,"y":750.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32830","byteOffset":20303976,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_3288AA36","articyId":"72057821671256038","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Harper Osiris","text":"By the way, did you meet my brother?","speakerId":"Ntt_1FFCB1D8","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"By the way, did you meet my brother?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5850.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50039","byteOffset":33273800,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_E7675AF9","articyId":"72057752951743023","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"You were tripping balls pal.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You were tripping balls pal.","TextSheVersion":"You were tripping balls pal.","TextTheyVersion":"You were tripping balls pal."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":625.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32881","byteOffset":20323816,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_E4F180B7","articyId":"72057752951743029","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"No more than anyone else in this city.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No more than anyone else in this city.","TextSheVersion":"No more than anyone else in this city.","TextTheyVersion":"No more than anyone else in this city."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":625.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45244","byteOffset":31451096,"byteLength":320}},{"id":"DFr_E792ACDB","articyId":"72057752951743045","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What happened? You said you'd taken something?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What happened? You said you'd taken something?","TextSheVersion":"What happened? You said you'd taken something?","TextTheyVersion":"What happened? You said you'd taken something?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47727","byteOffset":32391224,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_0F2748CF","articyId":"72057752951743067","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Mooing? Like a cow sound? I don't think so...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Mooing? Like a cow sound? I don't think so...","TextSheVersion":"Mooing? Like a cow sound? I don't think so...","TextTheyVersion":"Mooing? Like a cow sound? I don't think so..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1775.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45829","byteOffset":31670568,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_85565456","articyId":"72057752951743075","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"How crazy?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"How crazy?","TextSheVersion":"How crazy?","TextTheyVersion":"How crazy?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50545","byteOffset":33462856,"byteLength":292}},{"id":"DFr_748AECB2","articyId":"72057752951743089","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Sounds like the safest way to avoid CorpSec attention...","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sounds like the safest way to avoid CorpSec attention...","TextSheVersion":"Sounds like the safest way to avoid CorpSec attention...","TextTheyVersion":"Sounds like the safest way to avoid CorpSec attention..."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":500.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"20639","byteOffset":15692872,"byteLength":336}},{"id":"DFr_39BCEBD1","articyId":"72057752951743103","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"It kind of sounds... impressive.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It kind of sounds... impressive.","TextSheVersion":"It kind of sounds... impressive.","TextTheyVersion":"It kind of sounds... impressive."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29162","byteOffset":18914128,"byteLength":312}},{"id":"D